        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS proudly offer this ideally located and well-proportioned 4 bedroom semi-detached property with the added benefit of a side garage in Woodvale Drive, Clonsilla. The property requires modernisation throughout and offers excellent potential to create a fantastic family home. The Woodvale development is situated within close proximity to a variety of amenities including locals schools, shops, Blanchardstown Shopping centre, Connolly Hospital and the National Aquatic Centre to name a few. From a transport point of view you will find yourself well serviced by local and national bus routes, easy access to the M50 Motorway and the train services from Castleknock and Coolmine are only a short distance away.\n\nBright and spacious living accommodation extending to approximately 116 sq. m. comprises an entrance hall with guest WC, a generous living room to the front, a dining room, a fitted kitchen, and a second reception room to the rear, ideal as a home office, playroom or family room. This room provides access to both the garage and the private rear garden. Upstairs, the property offers four well-proportioned bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with an ensuite shower and wash hand basin, together with a family bathroom. Externally, the property boasts a beautifully maintained rear garden with side access to the front, an attached garage, and a front driveway providing off-street parking. While the property has been well cared for over the years, it would benefit from some modernisation, presenting an excellent opportunity for the new owners to update and personalise the home to their own taste.\n\nNo. 17 comes to the market with no onward chain  and offers an ideal opportunity for its next occupants to purchase a fantastically located property with heaps of potential!  Call Ray Cooke Auctioneers to register your interest.\n\nAdditional Features:\n\n<ul>\n <li>4 Bedroom Semi-Detached Home</li>\n <li>2 bathrooms & shower room</li>\n <li>Garage to the side with a variety of use</li>\n <li>c. 116 Sq m</li>\n <li>No onward chain</li>\n <li>Gas central heating</li>\n <li>BER E</li>\n <li>Gated side access</li>\n <li>Front driveway</li>\n <li>Ideally located</li>\n <li>Popular location</li>\n <li>Close to amenities</li>\n <li>Enquire today to arrange a viewing</li>\n</ul>\n\nDirections:\n\nEircode = D15 NXY4"
      },
      {
